            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Most dorsal part of the thalamus, comprising the pineal gland and habenular nuclei in most vertebrates. In a few vertebrates, it also includes the parietal eye. (Butler and Hodos, Comparative Vertebrate Neuroanatomy, 2nd ed, 2005, pg. 345-346.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>AAO:0010482</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BAMS:EPI</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
