        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The inferior or orbital surface of the frontal lobe is concave, and rests on the orbital plate of the frontal bone. It is divided into four orbital gyri by a well-marked H-shaped orbital sulcus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
