        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>decussation of lemniscus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>decussation of medial lemnisci</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>medial lemniscus decussation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>medullary sensory decussation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>sensory decussation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
