            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A white fibre bundle descending in the precommissural septum toward the base of the forebrain, immediately rostral to the lamina terminalis; at the base, the bundle turns in the caudolateral direction; traveling through the ventral substantia innominata alongside the optic tract, it fades before reaching the amygdala.</obo:IAO_0000115>
