        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A horseshoe-shaped thickening of the endoderm at the cranial (rostral) end of the primitive streak formed by the involution of Spemann&apos;s organizer cells which, together with the notochord, induces the formation of the neural plate from the overlying ectodermal cells and contributes mesodermal type cells to the surrounding tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
