        <obo:IAO_0000115>The lateral recess is a projection of the fourth ventricle which extends into the inferior cerebellar peduncle of the brainstem. The lateral aperture, an opening in each extremity of the lateral recess, provides a conduit for cerebrospinal fluid to flow from the brain&apos;s ventricular system into the subarachnoid space.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BAMS:LR4V</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
