            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A bone that is shaped as a broad flat plate and composed of two thin layers of compact tissue enclosing between them a variable quantity of cancellous tissue, which is the location of red bone marrow.</obo:IAO_0000115>
