        <obo:IAO_0000115>Brainstem tract formed by the central processes of first-order, trigeminal ganglion neurons that extends from the caudal medulla to the midpons. This tract conveys nociceptive and thermal information from the face to second-order neurons in the spinal nucleus of the trigeminal complex.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BAMS:sp5</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0003701</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
