        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>anterior perforated area</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>anterior perforated space</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>olfactory area (mai)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
