        <obo:IAO_0000115>A venule that is part of a lung and drains oxygenated blood from pulmonary capillaries. A pulmonary venule merges into a pulmonary vein branch that runs in the pulmonary interlobular septa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>pulmonary venule</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>pulmonary venule</skos:prefLabel>
